So, the correct assert statement should be:

<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < \old(this.size()); this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>

This ensures that all elements before the addition remain in the same position.

Thus, the final assert statement is:

<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < \old(this.size()); this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i));</code>
